{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工程实践MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的评估指标体系如何构建？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工程实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工程实践\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Agent 的评估指标体系如何构建？\" dir=\"auto\">Agent 的评估指标体系如何构建？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">如何构建 Agent 系统的评估指标体系？如何持续监控 Agent 的表现？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、Agent 评估的 5 个维度</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AgentEvaluator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent 综合评估体系\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    DIMENSIONS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 维度 1: 任务完成度 ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"task_completion\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"success_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"任务成功率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"step_efficiency\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"平均完成任务步数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"goal_achievement\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"目标达成率 (%)\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 维度 2: 回答质量 ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"response_quality\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"回答准确率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 对比标准答案</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"hallucination_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"幻觉率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 编造信息比例</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"citation_coverage\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"引用覆盖率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 有来源支撑的比例</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"fluency\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"语言流畅度评分\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 维度 3: 系统性能 ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"system_performance\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"ttft_p50\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"首字延迟 P50 (ms)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"e2e_latency_p50\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"端到端延迟 P50 (ms)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"throughput_qps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"吞吐量 (QPS)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"availability\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"可用性 (%)\"</span>             <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 99.9%</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 维度 4: 成本效率 ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"cost_efficiency\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"token_per_request\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每请求 Token 数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"cost_per_request\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每请求成本 ($)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"cache_hit_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"缓存命中率 (%)\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 维度 5: 用户体验 ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"user_experience\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"csat_score\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"用户满意度 (1-5)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>       <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &gt; 4.2</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"resolution_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AI 解决率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 未转人工比例</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"turn_count_avg\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"平均对话轮数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>         <span class=\"token comment\"># 越少越好</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"repeat_question_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"重复提问率 (%)\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 越低越好</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、评估方法</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>人工评估</strong></td>\n<td>标注员打分</td>\n<td>建立 Golden Set、Bad Case 分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>自动评估</strong></td>\n<td>LLM-as-Judge</td>\n<td>日常批量评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>A/B 测试</strong></td>\n<td>新旧版本对比</td>\n<td>发布前验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>用户反馈</strong></td>\n<td>点赞/点踩/评分</td>\n<td>在线质量监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、LLM-as-Judge 实现</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LLMJudge</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"使用独立 LLM 评估答案质量\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    EVAL_PROMPT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    请评估以下回答的质量，从准确性、相关性、完整性、安全性四个维度打分。\n    \n    问题：{question}\n    参考答案：{reference_answer}\n    实际回答：{actual_answer}\n    \n    请按以下格式输出：\n    准确性 (0-1): \n    相关性 (0-1):\n    完整性 (0-1):\n    安全性 (0-1):\n    综合评分 (0-1):\n    问题分析：\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">evaluate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> question<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> actual<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reference<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>EVAL_PROMPT<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">format</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            question<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>question<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            reference_answer<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>reference <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"无\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            actual_answer<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>actual\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>judge_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_parse_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、Golden Set 持续评估</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">GoldenSetEvaluator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Golden Set 日常评估\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>TestCase<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>golden_set <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> test_cases  <span class=\"token comment\"># 100-500 条标准测试用例</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>baseline_scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_run_eval<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">daily_run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Report<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"每日自动运行评估\"\"\"</span>\n        current_scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_run_eval<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        report <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"date\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> datetime<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>now<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"overall_score\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> current_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"overall\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"vs_baseline\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> current_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"overall\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>baseline_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"overall\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"regressed_cases\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_find_regressions<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>current_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"improved_cases\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_find_improvements<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>current_scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 分数下降 &gt; 5% 触发告警</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> report<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"vs_baseline\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">0.05</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_alert<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"质量回归告警\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> report<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> report\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"LLM-as-Judge 的评分可信吗？\"</strong> — 与人类标注一致性约 80-85%，需要定期校准</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"如何处理评估中的歧义案例？\"</strong> — 建立 Escalation 机制，争议案例由专家委员会裁定</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}